     lpSolve            5.6.19            the linear programs (estimation, Table A5)

     foreign            0.8-85            reading taxi015.dta

     lubridate          1.9.3             dates (merging the monthly CPI)

     fmsb               0.7.5             radar plots (Figures 6-9)


  Install them once with install.packages(c("lpSolve", "foreign", "lubridate",
  "fmsb")) . 00_run_all.R stops with this instruction if any is missing, and records the
  session details in output/sessionInfo.txt .

   03_figures_6_9.R draws with bmp(type = "windows") , which exists only on Windows.
  On macOS or Linux, change it to type = "cairo" .

  Hardware used. A laptop with an Intel Core i7-1165G7 (2.80 GHz, 4 cores, 8 threads) and 16
  GB of RAM. The package needs under 100 MB of disk space.

